// suggestions; the box shows them in a popup while it has the focus. Choosing a suggestion
// with the arrow keys or the pointer raises `SuggestionChosen` (and puts its text, by
// `TextMemberPath`, in the box when `UpdateTextOnSelect` is set); Enter, a click of a
// suggestion and the query button raise `QuerySubmitted`. The template is the control theme of
// the WinUI theme (`Controls/AutoSuggestBox.xaml`, from WinUI's `DefaultAutoSuggestBoxStyle`),
// with WinUI's parts: the text box `TextBox`, the popup `SuggestionsPopup` with
// `SuggestionsContainer` and the list `SuggestionsList`, and the button `QueryButton`. The
// Fluent and Simple themes have no template for it (docs/porting/winui-controls.md, section
// 5.1). Missing (docs/porting/winui-controls.md, Input): `AutoMaximizeSuggestionArea`,
// `LightDismissOverlayMode`, `TextBoxStyle`, `HeaderPlacement`, the input validation of WinUI
// and the placement of the list above the box when there is no room below.
