// `DownSpinButton`, the popup `UpDownPopup` with `PopupUpSpinButton` and
// `PopupDownSpinButton`, and `HeaderContentPresenter`. The control sets WinUI's visual states
// as pseudo-classes: `:spinbuttonsvisible` and `:spinbuttonspopup` (SpinButtonStates; neither
// is SpinButtonsCollapsed), `:upspinbuttondisabled` and `:downspinbuttondisabled`. The Fluent
// and Simple themes have no template for it (docs/porting/winui-controls.md, section 5.1).
